        <section id="career-custom-entry" class="career-custom-entry" hidden aria-labelledby="career-custom-title"><h4 id="career-custom-title">Add a career, course, or route</h4><p>Use this only when the catalogue does not contain the option you want to explore.</p><div class="form-grid two"><label><span>Name</span><input id="career-custom-name" maxlength="120" placeholder="For example: a local diploma or a specific role" /></label><label><span>Work area (optional)</span><input id="career-custom-category" maxlength="80" placeholder="Technology, health, business…" /></label></div><button id="career-use-custom" class="primary-button" type="button">Use this option</button></section>
        <div class="preset-toolbar"><label class="search-field"><Search size={16} /><span class="sr-only">Search careers</span><input id="career-preset-search" type="search" placeholder="Search every career by role, interest, work style, or skill" /></label><fieldset class="career-interest-filter"><legend>What interests or suits you? <small>(choose any; these are starting signals, not a test)</small></legend><div class="career-interest-group"><strong>Interests</strong><div class="career-interest-chips"><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="people" aria-pressed="false">Helping people</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="systems" aria-pressed="false">Technology and software</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="numbers" aria-pressed="false">Numbers and patterns</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="creative" aria-pressed="false">Creating and communicating</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="practical" aria-pressed="false">Making and fixing things</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="nature" aria-pressed="false">Nature and science</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="service" aria-pressed="false">Public issues and fairness</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="active" aria-pressed="false">Active and varied work</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="language" aria-pressed="false">Languages and cultures</button></div></div></div><div class="career-interest-group"><strong>How you prefer to work</strong><div class="career-interest-options"><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="independent" aria-pressed="false">Independent focus</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="collaborative" aria-pressed="false">Team problem solving</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="structured" aria-pressed="false">Clear structure</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="flexible" aria-pressed="false">Varied and flexible</button></div></div></div><div class="career-interest-group"><strong>Strengths you may already use</strong><div class="career-interest-options"><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="analytical" aria-pressed="false">Analysing and spotting patterns</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="verbal" aria-pressed="false">Explaining ideas clearly</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="hands-on" aria-pressed="false">Working with tools or materials</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="empathetic" aria-pressed="false">Understanding people</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="visual" aria-pressed="false">Seeing visual details</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="organised" aria-pressed="false">Organising people or work</button></div></div></div><div class="career-interest-group"><strong>What matters in your choice</strong><div class="career-interest-options"><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="earning" aria-pressed="false">Strong earning upside</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="stability" aria-pressed="false">Stability and continuity</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="impact" aria-pressed="false">Social or environmental impact</button></div><div class="career-interest-control"><button type="button" class="career-interest-chip" data-career-interest="mobility" aria-pressed="false">International mobility</button></div></div></div><p id="career-interest-guidance" class="field-help" aria-live="polite">Choose one or two interests or a study stage to narrow the catalogue. These are starting signals, not test results.</p></fieldset><label><span>Study stage and subject route</span><select id="career-study-stage"><option value="all">Any stage or subject route</option><option value="after-10th">After Class 10</option><option value="after-12th-science">After Class 12 · Science</option><option value="after-12th-maths">After Class 12 · Mathematics / PCM</option><option value="after-12th-biology">After Class 12 · Biology / PCB</option><option value="after-12th-pcmb">After Class 12 · PCMB</option><option value="after-12th-commerce">After Class 12 · Commerce</option><option value="after-12th-humanities">After Class 12 · Humanities / Arts</option><option value="college">College or early career</option><option value="working">Working or changing careers</option></select><small>Use this to prioritise realistic routes; it does not rule out a different path.</small></label><label><span>Area of work</span><select id="career-preset-category"><option value="all">All areas of work</option><option value="featured">Good places to start</option><option value="future">Work changing quickly</option><option value="Technology &amp; Data">Technology &amp; software</option><option value="Engineering &amp; Built Environment">Engineering &amp; the built world</option><option value="Health &amp; Life Sciences">Health &amp; life sciences</option><option value="Commerce, Finance &amp; Economics">Finance, business &amp; economics</option><option value="Business, Marketing &amp; Operations">Business, marketing &amp; operations</option><option value="Design, Media &amp; Creative Arts">Design, media &amp; creative work</option><option value="Law, Government &amp; Public Service">Law, government &amp; public service</option><option value="Education, Psychology &amp; Social Impact">Education, psychology &amp; social impact</option><option value="Science, Research &amp; Environment">Science, research &amp; environment</option><option value="Hospitality, Travel, Sports &amp; Events">Hospitality, travel, sport &amp; events</option><option value="Agriculture, Food &amp; Rural Careers">Agriculture, food &amp; rural work</option><option value="Skilled Trades &amp; Applied Careers">Skilled trades &amp; applied work</option><option value="Languages, International &amp; Emerging Routes">Languages, international &amp; emerging work</option><option value="Future-ready &amp; Cross-functional">Emerging &amp; cross-disciplinary work</option></select></label><label><span>Career group</span><select id="career-preset-group"><option value="all">All career groups</option><option value="Builders">Builders</option><option value="Analysers">Analysers</option><option value="Communicators">Communicators</option><option value="Healers">Healers</option><option value="Makers">Makers</option></select><small>Start with a broad kind of work, then compare individual roles.</small></label><label><span>Show first</span><select id="career-preset-sort"><option value="recommended">Best starting points</option><option value="alphabetical">A to Z</option><option value="quick-test">Quickest ways to try it</option><option value="future-ready">Future-ready skills</option><option value="independent">Paths that can become independent work</option></select></label></div>
        <div class="career-library-layout"><div id="career-preset-results" class="career-library-results">{guidedCareerPresets.slice(0, 24).map((guide) => <div class="career-library-result"><button type="button" data-career-preset={guide.key}><span class="career-result-title"><strong>{guide.title}</strong></span><small>{guide.category === 'Technology & Data' ? 'Technology & software' : guide.category}</small><p>{guide.summary}</p><div class="career-result-facts"><span><b>Interests</b>{guide.interestTags?.slice(0, 2).join(' · ')}</span><span><b>Skills to begin</b>{guide.specialistSkills?.slice(0, 2).join(' · ')}</span></div></button><label class="career-compare-toggle"><input type="checkbox" data-compare-career={guide.key} aria-label={`Compare ${guide.title}`} /><span>Compare</span></label></div>)}</div><aside id="career-guide-preview" class="career-guide-preview"><div class="career-guide-empty"><Lightbulb size={20} /><strong>Choose a career to see the practical work</strong><span>Daily tasks, entry routes, future change, skill requirements, watch-outs, and practical tests appear here.</span></div></aside></div>
      </section>
      <section id="career-compare-panel" class="career-compare-panel" hidden aria-labelledby="career-compare-heading"></section>
      <div id="career-save-choice" class="career-manual-divider"><span>Save your choice</span></div>
      <p class="form-help">Choose any number of primary or secondary career options. Your plan is flexible: change an option’s role whenever your interests, evidence, or circumstances change.</p>
      <div class="decision-role-grid">
        <fieldset class="segmented-field"><legend>How would you like to keep this career option?</legend><div class="segmented-control"><label><input type="radio" name="option_type" value="primary" checked /><span><strong>Primary career option</strong><small>One you want to explore seriously</small></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="option_type" value="alternative" /><span><strong>Secondary career option</strong><small>One you want to keep open or test</small></span></label></div></fieldset>
      </div>
      <label class="career-check-in-field"><span>Date to test or revisit <em>(optional)</em></span><input name="decision_deadline" type="date" /><small class="field-help">Choose when you will complete a small test or look at the evidence again. This is a reminder in your plan; it does not send a notification.</small></label>
      <input name="status" type="hidden" value="exploring" />
      <details id="career-detail-fields" class="career-detail-fields"><summary>Additional coach notes (optional)</summary><div class="career-detail-fields-body"><div class="form-grid three"><label>Decision status<select aria-label="Decision now" name="decision_signal"><option value="ready-to-pursue">Ready to pursue</option><option value="promising-to-test">Promising, test next</option><option value="deliberate-alternative">Keep as a secondary option</option><option value="needs-evidence" selected>Needs more evidence</option><option value="not-now">Not right now</option></select></label><label>Evidence so far<select name="evidence_strength"><option value="none">No practical evidence yet</option><option value="early">Early signal</option><option value="moderate">Several useful tests</option><option value="strong">Strong practical proof</option></select></label><label>Future outlook<select name="future_outlook"><option value="growing">Growing</option><option value="evolving" selected>Evolving</option><option value="stable">Stable</option><option value="niche">Niche</option><option value="uncertain">Uncertain</option></select></label></div>
        <label>Education or entry routes<textarea name="route_summary" rows="2" maxlength="3000"></textarea></label>
        <label>Requirements and proof employers or courses expect<textarea name="entry_requirements" rows="2" maxlength="3000"></textarea></label>
        <label>Typical work environment<input name="work_environment" maxlength="1200" /></label>
        <div class="form-grid two"><label>Evidence this may suit the student<textarea name="reasons" rows="3" maxlength="2000" placeholder="One observed reason per line"></textarea></label><label>Trade-offs or watch-outs<textarea name="tradeoffs" rows="3" maxlength="2000" placeholder="One real trade-off per line"></textarea></label></div>
        <label>Question that still needs an answer<input name="review_question" maxlength="300" placeholder="What evidence would change or strengthen this decision?" /></label>
        <label>Useful next step<input name="next_step" maxlength="180" placeholder="A practical task, practitioner conversation, observation, or course activity" /></label>
      </div></details>
      <div id="career-option-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>
    <footer><button class="secondary-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="career-option-dialog">Cancel</button><button id="career-save-submit" class="primary-button" type="submit" aria-label="Save career option"><Check size={16} /><span id="career-save-label">Save career option</span></button></footer>
  </form>
</section>

 <dialog id="skill-plan-dialog" class="workspace-dialog guided-dialog" aria-labelledby="skill-plan-dialog-title">
  <form id="skill-plan-form" method="dialog" class="dialog-form">
     <header><div><p class="eyebrow">Skills and evidence</p><h2 id="skill-plan-dialog-title">Add a complete skill plan</h2></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="skill-plan-dialog" aria-label="Close" title="Close"><X size={18} /></button></header>
    <div class="dialog-body">
      <div id="skill-plan-context" class="decision-context-strip"></div>
      <div class="preset-toolbar"><label class="search-field"><Search size={16} /><span class="sr-only">Search skill plans</span><input id="skill-pack-search" type="search" placeholder="Search skill plans or career families" /></label><label><span class="sr-only">Skill plan group</span><select id="skill-pack-group"><option value="recommended">Recommended for this student</option><option value="all">All skill plans</option><option value="Start strong">Start strong</option><option value="Holistic foundations">Holistic foundations</option><option value="Work with technology">Work with technology</option><option value="Career families">Career families</option><option value="Move into work">Move into work</option></select></label><label id="skill-pack-career-field" hidden><span>Link career-specific skills to</span><select id="skill-pack-career"><option value="">Choose a career option</option></select></label></div>
      <div class="skill-plan-layout"><div id="skill-pack-results" class="skill-pack-results"></div><aside id="skill-pack-preview" class="skill-pack-preview"><div class="career-guide-empty"><ListPlus size={20} /><strong>Choose a skill plan</strong><span>You can review every skill and untick anything that is already covered.</span></div></aside></div>
      <div id="skill-plan-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>
    <footer><button class="secondary-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="skill-plan-dialog">Cancel</button><button id="add-skill-pack" class="primary-button" type="submit" disabled><ListPlus size={16} /> Add selected skills</button></footer>
  </form>
</dialog>

 <dialog id="skill-dialog" class="workspace-dialog guided-dialog" aria-labelledby="skill-dialog-title">
  <form id="skill-form" method="dialog" class="dialog-form">
    <header><div><p class="eyebrow">Skills and evidence</p><h2 id="skill-dialog-title">Add one skill</h2></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="skill-dialog" aria-label="Close" title="Close"><X size={18} /></button></header>
    <div class="dialog-body">
      <input name="id" type="hidden" /><input name="preset_key" type="hidden" />
      <p id="skill-dialog-intro" class="form-help">Start with the closest honest level: what the student can show today without guessing. Add a regular activity and a piece of proof so this becomes a useful plan, not just a label.</p>
      <section id="skill-preset-picker" class="preset-picker" aria-labelledby="skill-preset-heading"><div class="preset-picker-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Single-skill library</p><h3 id="skill-preset-heading">Choose a starting skill</h3></div><span id="skill-preset-count" class="scope-note"></span></div><div class="preset-toolbar"><label class="search-field"><Search size={16} /><span class="sr-only">Search skills</span><input id="skill-preset-search" type="search" placeholder="Search skills" /></label><label><span class="sr-only">Skill category</span><select id="skill-preset-category"><option value="featured">Recommended foundations</option><option value="all">All categories</option></select></label></div><div id="skill-preset-results" class="preset-results"></div></section>
      <div class="form-grid two"><label id="skill-name-label"><span>Skill</span><input name="skill_name" maxlength="120" required /></label><label id="skill-category-label"><span>Category</span><select name="category"><option value="technical">Technical</option><option value="digital">Digital</option><option value="communication">Communication</option><option value="analytical">Analytical</option><option value="creative">Creative</option><option value="leadership">Leadership</option><option value="domain">Domain</option><option value="language">Language</option><option value="employability">Employability</option></select></label></div>
      <div class="form-grid two"><label id="skill-current-label"><span>Current ability</span><select name="current_level"><option value="0">Not started</option><option value="1">Aware or beginner</option><option value="2">Can do with support</option><option value="3">Can do independently</option><option value="4">Can adapt or teach</option></select></label><div class="skill-scale-note"><span>Ability scale</span><p>Use the same scale on the skill card: 0 means not started and 4 means the student can adapt or teach it.</p></div></div>
      <details id="skill-detail-fields" class="skill-detail-fields"><summary>Optional plan details</summary><div class="skill-detail-fields-body"><div class="form-grid two"><label>Skill group<select name="skill_scope"><option value="foundation">Core skills</option><option value="career-specific">Career-specific skills for this career option</option><option value="future-ready">Future-ready skills</option><option value="employability">Work skills</option><option value="personal-effectiveness">Ways of working</option></select></label><label>Linked career<select id="skill-linked-career" name="linked_career_path_id"><option value="">Applies across careers</option></select></label></div><div class="form-grid two"><label>Importance<select name="priority"><option value="core">Essential</option><option value="important" selected>Important</option><option value="useful">Useful later</option></select></label><label>Progress<select name="status"><option value="identified">Not started</option><option value="developing">Building</option><option value="demonstrated">Demonstrated with proof</option></select></label></div><p class="form-help">Use Core skills for abilities every career needs. Use Career-specific skills for a chosen career option. A skill can be saved now and completed later.</p><label>Development outcome<textarea name="development_goal" rows="2" maxlength="1200" placeholder="What useful capability should improve?"></textarea></label><div class="form-grid two"><label>How will the student build this skill?<textarea name="practice_method" rows="2" maxlength="1200" placeholder="What will the student do regularly to practise this skill?"></textarea></label><label>Proof of competence<textarea name="success_criteria" rows="2" maxlength="1200" placeholder="What evidence will show this skill is ready?"></textarea></label></div></div></details><div id="skill-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>
    <footer><button class="secondary-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="skill-dialog">Cancel</button><button class="primary-button" type="submit"><Check size={16} /> Save skill</button></footer>
  </form>
</dialog>

 <dialog id="skill-review-dialog" class="workspace-dialog guided-dialog" aria-labelledby="skill-review-dialog-title">
  <form id="skill-review-form" method="dialog" class="dialog-form">
    <header><div><p class="eyebrow">Skill review</p><h2 id="skill-review-dialog-title">Add coach feedback</h2></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="skill-review-dialog" aria-label="Close" title="Close"><X size={18} /></button></header>
    <div class="dialog-body"><input name="id" type="hidden" /><input name="skill_id" type="hidden" /><p id="skill-review-context" class="dialog-context"></p><p class="form-help">Record one specific observation and one suggested next step. Ratings use the same 0–10 scale: 0 = not useful yet, 1–2 = just starting, 3–4 = some progress, 5–6 = useful when used regularly, 7–8 = working well, and 9–10 = clear and very useful.</p><div id="coach-review-fields"><label>Date recorded<input name="coach_reviewed_on" type="date" /></label><label>Coach feedback<textarea name="coach_feedback" rows="4" maxlength="5000" placeholder="What did you observe, and what should the student practise next?"></textarea></label><div class="form-grid two"><label class="rating-field"><span>Coach satisfaction (0–10)</span><div class="rating-slider" data-rating-slider-shell><input type="hidden" name="coach_satisfaction_set" value="false" data-rating-presence /><input type="range" aria-label="Coach satisfaction" name="coach_satisfaction" min="0" max="10" step="1" value="0" data-rating-slider /><output data-rating-output aria-live="polite">Choose a score</output></div></label><label>Suggested next step<input name="next_focus" maxlength="1200" placeholder="The next observable improvement" /></label></div></div><div id="student-review-fields" hidden><label class="rating-field"><span>Student satisfaction (0–10)</span><div class="rating-slider" data-rating-slider-shell><input type="hidden" name="student_satisfaction_set" value="false" data-rating-presence /><input type="range" aria-label="Student satisfaction" name="student_satisfaction" min="0" max="10" step="1" value="0" data-rating-slider /><output data-rating-output aria-live="polite">Choose a score</output></div></label><label>Student reflection<textarea name="student_feedback" rows="4" maxlength="3000" placeholder="What is helping, and what would make this skill plan clearer?"></textarea></label></div><div id="skill-review-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></div></div>
    <footer><button class="secondary-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="skill-review-dialog">Cancel</button><button class="primary-button" type="submit"><Check size={16} /> Save review</button></footer>
  </form>
</dialog>

 <dialog id="advice-dialog" class="workspace-dialog guided-dialog" aria-labelledby="advice-dialog-title">
  <form id="advice-form" method="dialog" class="dialog-form">
     <header><div><p class="eyebrow">Student follow-through</p><h2 id="advice-dialog-title">Add coach guidance</h2></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="advice-dialog" aria-label="Close" title="Close"><X size={18} /></button></header>
    <div class="dialog-body"><input name="id" type="hidden" /><p class="form-help">Use one entry for one clear next move. The date records when you shared it; the due date records when the student should act. You can link it to the student’s current cohort when it relates to group work.</p><label>Date shared<input name="advice_date" type="date" required /></label><label>Short title<input name="title" maxlength="180" required placeholder="For example: Speak to two practitioners this week" /></label><label>Your guidance<textarea name="advice" rows="5" maxlength="5000" required placeholder="Write what the student should do, why it matters, and what a useful result looks like."></textarea></label><div class="form-grid two"><label>Due date<input name="due_date" type="date" /></label><label>Status<select name="status"><option value="open">Open</option><option value="in-progress">In progress</option><option value="done">Done</option><option value="archived">Archived</option></select></label></div><label>Cohort link<select id="advice-cohort" name="cohort_id"><option value="">No cohort link</option></select></label><div id="advice-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></div></div>
    <footer><button class="secondary-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="advice-dialog">Cancel</button><button class="primary-button" type="submit"><Plus size={16} /> Save guidance</button></footer>
  </form>
</dialog>

 <dialog id="evidence-dialog" class="workspace-dialog" aria-labelledby="evidence-dialog-title">
  <form id="evidence-form" method="dialog" class="dialog-form">
     <header><div><p class="eyebrow">Skill proof</p><h2 id="evidence-dialog-title">Add evidence</h2></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="evidence-dialog" aria-label="Close" title="Close"><X size={18} /></button></header>
    <div class="dialog-body"><input name="id" type="hidden" /><input name="skill_id" type="hidden" /><input name="title" type="hidden" value="Skill evidence" /><input name="evidence_type" type="hidden" value="work-sample" /><input name="evidence_date" type="hidden" /><input name="observed_level" type="hidden" /><p id="evidence-skill-name" class="dialog-context"></p><label>Description (optional)<textarea name="description" rows="5" maxlength="5000" placeholder="Describe what you made, tried, or learned."></textarea></label><label>Links to proof (optional)<textarea name="source_url" rows="4" maxlength="4000" placeholder="Paste one https:// link per line"></textarea><small class="field-help">Add as many links as you need, one per line.</small></label><div id="evidence-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></div></div>
    <footer><button class="secondary-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="evidence-dialog">Cancel</button><button class="primary-button" type="submit"><Plus size={16} /><span id="evidence-submit-label">Add evidence</span></button></footer>
  </form>
</dialog>

 <dialog id="session-dialog" class="workspace-dialog guided-dialog" aria-labelledby="session-dialog-title">
  <form id="session-form" method="dialog" class="dialog-form">
    <header><div><p class="eyebrow">Individual coaching</p><h2 id="session-dialog-title">Schedule session</h2></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="session-dialog" aria-label="Close" title="Close"><X size={18} /></button></header>
    <div class="dialog-body">
      <p class="form-help">Use this for a one-to-one coaching conversation with the selected student. Record the purpose before the session, then add the outcome and decisions afterward.</p>
      <label>Date and time<input name="scheduled_at" type="datetime-local" required /></label>
      <div class="form-grid two"><label>Facilitator<select id="individual-session-facilitator" name="facilitator_id" required></select></label><label>Duration (minutes)<input name="duration_minutes" type="number" min="15" max="240" value="45" required /></label></div>
      <div class="form-grid two"><label>Session type<select name="session_type"><option value="intake">Intake and context</option><option value="career-review">Career review</option><option value="skill-planning">Skill planning</option><option value="option-research">Option research</option><option value="decision">Decision review</option><option value="follow-up">Follow-up</option></select></label><label>Status<select name="status"><option value="scheduled">Scheduled</option><option value="completed">Completed</option><option value="cancelled">Cancelled</option><option value="no-show">No-show</option></select></label></div>
      <label>Agenda<textarea name="agenda" rows="3" maxlength="3000" placeholder="What should this conversation accomplish?"></textarea></label>
      <label>Outcome summary<textarea name="student_summary" rows="3" maxlength="5000" placeholder="After the session: what was agreed and what happens next?"></textarea></label>
      <label>Decisions and commitments<textarea name="decisions" rows="3" maxlength="3000" placeholder="Record decisions, owners, and dates."></textarea></label>
      <div id="individual-session-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>
    <footer><button class="secondary-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="session-dialog">Cancel</button><button class="primary-button" type="submit"><CalendarDays size={16} /> Save session</button></footer>
  </form>
</dialog>

 <dialog id="cohort-dialog" class="workspace-dialog detail-dialog" aria-labelledby="cohort-dialog-title">
  <form id="cohort-form" method="dialog" class="dialog-form">
    <header><div><p class="eyebrow">Group coaching delivery</p><h2 id="cohort-dialog-title">New cohort</h2></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="cohort-dialog" aria-label="Close" title="Close"><X size={18} /></button></header>
    <div class="dialog-body"><input name="id" type="hidden" /><p class="form-help">A cohort is the shared coaching group. Give it a clear name, place it in the right branch, set who leads it, and add the next session after saving. The system adds the permanent cohort code and serial prefix for you.</p><label>Start from a cohort format<select id="cohort-preset"><option value="">Choose a practical starting format</option></select></label><div class="form-grid two"><label>Cohort name<input name="name" maxlength="120" required placeholder="For example: Class 11 Career Options · July" /><small class="field-help">Your name will be shown with the cohort serial prefix.</small></label><label>Permanent cohort code<input id="cohort-code" name="code" maxlength="32" placeholder="Generated after saving" readonly /><small class="field-help">Generated automatically and cannot be changed.</small></label></div><div class="form-grid two"><label>Branch<select id="cohort-branch" name="branch_id" required></select></label><label>Lead (optional)<select id="cohort-lead" name="lead_id"></select></label></div><div class="form-grid four"><label>Programme<select name="program_track"><option value="career-foundations">Career foundations</option><option value="stream-selection">Stream selection</option><option value="college-and-course">College and course</option><option value="career-launch">Career launch</option><option value="career-transition">Career transition</option><option value="exam-and-alternatives">Exams and alternatives</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select></label><label>Stage<select name="coaching_stage"><option value="mixed">Mixed</option><option value="intake">Intake</option><option value="self-discovery">Self-discovery</option><option value="career-exploration">Career exploration</option><option value="option-validation">Option validation</option><option value="decision">Decision</option><option value="execution">Execution</option><option value="follow-up">Follow-up</option></select></label><label>Delivery<select name="delivery_mode"><option value="in-person">In person</option><option value="online">Online</option><option value="hybrid">Hybrid</option></select></label><label>Capacity<input name="capacity" type="number" min="1" max="500" value="30" required /></label></div><div class="form-grid three"><label>Starts (optional)<input name="starts_on" type="date" /></label><label>Ends (optional)<input name="ends_on" type="date" /></label><label>Status<select name="status"><option value="upcoming">Upcoming</option><option value="active" selected>Active</option><option value="completed">Completed</option><option value="archived">Archived</option></select></label></div><label>Coaching rhythm (optional)<input name="schedule_note" maxlength="1000" placeholder="For example: two group sessions per month" /></label><label>Purpose and audience (optional)<textarea name="description" rows="3" maxlength="2000" placeholder="What should the group achieve?"></textarea></label><div id="cohort-form-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></div></div>
    <footer><button class="secondary-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="cohort-dialog">Cancel</button><button class="primary-button" type="submit"><Check size={16} /> Save cohort</button></footer>
  </form>
</dialog>

 <dialog id="cohort-session-dialog" class="workspace-dialog guided-dialog" aria-labelledby="cohort-session-dialog-title">
  <form id="cohort-session-form" method="dialog" class="dialog-form">
    <header><div><p class="eyebrow">Cohort communication</p><h2 id="cohort-session-dialog-title">Share a cohort announcement</h2></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="cohort-session-dialog" aria-label="Close" title="Close"><X size={18} /></button></header>
    <div class="dialog-body"><input name="id" type="hidden" /><input name="cohort_id" type="hidden" /><p id="cohort-session-context" class="dialog-context"></p><p class="form-help">Announce one clear conversation for the whole cohort. The topic and date are visible to students; preparation and the outcome summary can be added when ready.</p><label>Start from a session plan<select id="session-preset"><option value="">Choose a session topic</option></select></label><label>Topic<input name="topic" maxlength="180" required placeholder="For example: Compare two career routes" /></label><div class="form-grid two"><label>Date and time<input name="starts_at" type="datetime-local" required /></label><label>Facilitator<select id="session-facilitator" name="facilitator_id" required></select></label></div><div class="form-grid four"><label>Session type<select name="session_type"><option value="orientation">Orientation</option><option value="self-discovery">Self-discovery</option><option value="career-discovery">Career discovery</option><option value="career-options">Career options</option><option value="skill-building">Skill building</option><option value="decision-planning">Decision planning</option><option value="execution">Execution</option><option value="industry-exposure">Industry exposure</option><option value="parent-briefing">Parent briefing</option><option value="progress-review">Progress review</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></label><label>Duration<input name="duration_minutes" type="number" min="15" max="240" value="60" required /></label><label>Delivery<select name="delivery_mode"><option value="in-person">In person</option><option value="online">Online</option><option value="hybrid">Hybrid</option></select></label><label>Status<select name="status"><option value="announced">Announced</option><option value="completed">Completed</option><option value="cancelled">Cancelled</option></select></label></div><label>Venue or meeting link (optional)<input name="venue_or_link" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Room, address, or https:// meeting link" /></label><label>Agenda (optional)<textarea name="agenda" rows="3" maxlength="3000" placeholder="What will the group work through?"></textarea></label><label>Student preparation (optional)<textarea name="preparation" rows="2" maxlength="2000" placeholder="What should students bring or do first?"></textarea></label><label>Student-visible outcome summary (optional)<textarea name="student_summary" rows="3" maxlength="5000" placeholder="Decisions, resources, or commitments"></textarea></label><div id="session-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></div></div>
    <footer><button class="secondary-button" type="button" data-close-dialog="cohort-session-dialog">Cancel</button><button class="primary-button" type="submit"><Megaphone size={16} /> Save announcement</button></footer>
  </form>
</dialog>

