      <section class="workspace-view" data-workspace-view="profile" aria-labelledby="student-profile-heading" hidden>
        <section class="work-panel student-profile-panel" aria-labelledby="student-profile-heading">
          <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your profile</p><h3 id="student-profile-heading">Your profile</h3><p class="field-help">Keep your name and planning context current so your coaching team can support you clearly.</p></div><UserRound size={18} /></div>
          <form id="student-profile-form" class="compact-form">
            <label>Full name<input name="full_name" maxlength="100" required placeholder="Your name" /></label>
            <fieldset class="student-context-fields"><legend>Your planning context</legend><p class="field-help">Share the practical details that should shape your coaching plan. You can change them whenever your circumstances change.</p><div class="form-grid two"><label>When do you need an income?<select name="education_timeline"><option value="">Choose a timeframe</option><option value="6 months">Within 6 months</option><option value="1 year">Within 1 year</option><option value="1.5 years">Within 1½ years</option><option value="2 years">Within 2 years</option><option value="2.5 years">Within 2½ years</option><option value="3 years or more">In 3 years or more</option></select></label><label>Learning time each week<input name="available_hours_per_week" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="1" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="For example, 8" /></label></div><div class="form-grid two"><label>Device access<select name="device_access"><option value="">Choose one</option><option value="shared-phone">Shared phone</option><option value="personal-phone">Personal phone</option><option value="shared-computer">Shared computer</option><option value="personal-computer">Personal computer</option></select></label><label>Internet access<select name="internet_access"><option value="">Choose one</option><option value="limited">Limited connection</option><option value="mobile-only">Mobile data only</option><option value="reliable">Reliable connection</option></select></label></div><label>Interests to consider<input name="interest_themes" maxlength="1000" placeholder="For example: people, design, numbers, nature" /><small class="field-help">Separate several interests with commas.</small></label><label>Non-negotiables or practical limits<textarea aria-label="Non-negotiables or practical limits" name="non_negotiables" rows="2" maxlength="2000" placeholder="For example: must stay near home, family responsibilities, or access needs"></textarea></label></fieldset>
            <div class="form-actions"><span id="student-profile-saved-at"></span><button class="secondary-button" type="submit"><Check size={16} /> Save profile</button></div>
            <div id="student-profile-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></div>
          </form>
        </section>
      </section>
      <section class="workspace-view" data-workspace-view="role-lab" data-local-only="true" aria-labelledby="role-lab-heading" hidden>
          <div class="view-toolbar"><div><p class="eyebrow">Access preview</p><h2 id="role-lab-heading">Preview access by role</h2><p class="view-copy">Create temporary preview accounts to check what each role can see and do.</p></div><button id="seed-role-lab" class="primary-button" type="button"><FlaskConical size={16} /> Create preview accounts</button></div>
          <div class="notice secure"><ShieldCheck size={18} /><span>Available only on this local dashboard. Preview accounts are temporary and cannot be created from a remote site.</span></div>
          <div id="role-lab-credentials" class="credential-grid"></div>
          <section class="lab-approval-strip"><div><p class="eyebrow">Approval test</p><h3>Riya Approval Student</h3><p>A pending student request appears in Accounts after the lab is prepared.</p></div><button class="secondary-button" type="button" data-open-view="accounts">Open accounts <ChevronRight size={16} /></button></section>
