        <p class="form-help">Choose the person’s actual role and reporting line. Students do not self-register; lower-hierarchy accounts stay pending until an Admin approves them. After approval, the person signs in with the secure setup link or the one-time password shown to the person who created or approved the account.</p>
        <div class="form-grid two"><label>Full name<input name="fullName" maxlength="100" required /></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" maxlength="254" required /></label></div>
        <div class="form-grid two"><label><span id="account-role-label">Role</span><select id="account-role" name="role" required></select></label><label><span id="account-branch-label">Branch</span><select id="account-branch" name="branchId" required></select></label></div>
